OL,3,GNEWSACity park's play area closes as
OL,4,Arevamp approaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city play area has closed for a major
OL,7,Frevamp.
OL,9,FCoventry City Council said the play
OL,10,Farea at War Memorial Park was outdated
OL,11,Fand it had received additional funding
OL,12,Fto rebuild it, replace the water
OL,13,Ffeature and put a multi-use games area
OL,14,Fin its place.
OL,16,FVisitors have told BBC CWR that when
OL,17,Fthey arrived at Coventry's War Memorial
OL,18,FPark, the play area for children was
OL,19,Ffenced off with a notice suggesting it
OL,20,Fwill re-open in 2027.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
