OL,3,GNEWSACity park's play area closes as
OL,4,Arevamp approaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FSandra Park was there with her
OL,7,Fgrandchildren, only to find it closed.
OL,8,F"We were just very disappointed to be
OL,9,Fhonest. We realised that the kids have
OL,10,Fgone back to school but there are other
OL,11,Fchildren" she told BBC CWR.
